---
// PulseSection Component: Intelligent metric anomaly alerts with answers attached
---

<section class="section-wrapper pulse-section" id="pulse">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pulse-grid">
      <!-- Left: Copy & Explanations -->
      <div class="pulse-copy">
        <span class="section-tag">06 · Pulse</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">One thread out of line, and you hear about it first.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">
          Pulse learns what normal looks like for every metric you care about and only speaks up when something is both unusual and large enough to matter. Each alert arrives with the answer attached.
        </p>

        <div class="pulse-features-list">
          <div class="pf-item">
            <span class="pf-check">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Quiet by default</strong>
              <p>About two alerts a week for a typical growth team, not forty noisy notifications.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pf-item">
            <span class="pf-check">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Explained</strong>
              <p>Each alert includes the historical baseline, the exact change, and the three biggest moving rows.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pf-item">
            <span class="pf-check">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>In your channel</strong>
              <p>Delivered to Slack, email or webhook, threaded so team follow-up questions stay together.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Alert Mockup Card & Snagged Cloth Visual -->
      <div class="pulse-visual-card">
        <div class="alert-mockup">
          <div class="alert-header">
            <span class="alert-status-dot"></span>
            <span class="alert-time">09:14 · Today</span>
            <span class="alert-tag">High Priority</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="alert-title">EU card payments failing</h3>
          <p class="alert-detail">
            <strong>212 invoices declined</strong> since 07:40, six times the usual rate. 91% share one processor error code (<span class="mono">err_card_declined_3ds</span>).
          </p>

          <div class="alert-footer">
            <span class="alert-rows-count">Affected rows: 212 accounts</span>
            <span class="alert-action">View thread →</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pulse-image-box">
          <img
            src="/images/9xX8AGgfHFP5xQdY5erK7PtReeg.jpg"
            alt="A snagged vermilion thread running through woven cloth"
            loading="lazy"
            class="snagged-img"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pulse-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .pulse-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .pulse-features-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .pf-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .pf-check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-tag);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pf-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .pf-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Right Visual */
  .pulse-visual-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .alert-mockup {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(17, 19, 23, 0.06);
  }

  .alert-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .alert-status-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--accent);
  }

  .alert-time {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  .alert-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--accent-light);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .alert-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .alert-detail {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .alert-detail .mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    background: var(--bg-tag);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .alert-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .alert-rows-count {
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  .alert-action {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .pulse-image-box {
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #dedcd7;
  }

  .snagged-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
</style>
